.SH NAME
ssoossh-ssh-logout - Remove ssoossh-managed keys and certificates from the agent (or files).


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBssoossh ssh logout [flags] [args]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Removes the certificates ssoossh put in your ssh-agent — those signed by the configured CA — and nothing else. Your own keys are left alone. When key files are used instead of an agent, the files ssoossh wrote are deleted.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for logout


